+# as a multimodal message to a vision-capable LLM (Claude / gpt-4o / gemini) via TokenRouter.
+# The model returns the SAME storyboard JSON contract used by step 3 (scriptGen), so the
+# generated script can be edited, renamed, saved to the library (kind="script"), and then
+# read straight back in from step 3's library panel.
+#
+# meta shape mirrors scriptGen so the two are interchangeable:
+#   meta = { title, plot, duration, system_prompt, prompt, storyboard{scene,shots[]},
+#            script (human-readable), characters:[] }
